Subject: [ATHENA] Add All Tools component layer

Adds the Athena-Nexus read-only All Tools view:

- Tool catalog API client
- Tool cards and category filtering
- Tool detail inspector dialog
- Adapter health panel
- Activity feed
- Athena renderer bootstrap
- Athena-specific stylesheets

This patch does not add arbitrary command execution.
Workflow requests remain disabled until policy validation,
approval records, and isolated workers are implemented.